    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Ego plays a subtle role everywhere - not only in men but in mice also!",
      "path": "audio/1971-324/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.092313,
      "end": 7.451247
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "An arrogant elephant looked down contemptuously at a mouse and said: You are just about the skinniest little creature I have ever seen.",
      "path": "audio/1971-324/03.mp3",
      "start": 8.916327,
      "end": 16.267347
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I am not always like this, squeaked the mouse.",
